<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>An earthly paradise... I see...<PG>
Come to think of it, although the name of the Arata settlement comes up often, the only person from there who has appeared is Eiichiro Niimura.<PG>
If anything, he was a very, very ordinary person who tried to remain a good man to the end.<PG>
If it is a place that does no harm, then rather, a place removed from civilization with a culture of its own―
{PAUSE ""}
that would mean it chose isolation over civilization.<PG>
Having chosen isolation, it may be a place one could call a paradise, where people wish to stay even at the cost of civilization.<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
